[2026-01-30T08:13:37.880Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01S3YeenhwmuvwbEhu9wqkJL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Implementation Complete\n\nI've successfully added focus trap and improved modal accessibility to the report components.\n\n### Changes Made:\n\n**1. Created `useFocusTrap` hook (`src/hooks/useFocusTrap.ts`)**\n- Traps tab navigation within the modal container\n- Stores previously focused element and returns focus on close\n- Auto-focuses the first focusable element when modal opens\n- Handles Shift+Tab wrapping from first to last element and vice versa\n- Supports configurable options: `enabled`, `returnFocusTo`, `autoFocus`\n\n**2. Updated `ReportShell` (`src/components/report/ReportShell.tsx`)**\n- Added `useFocusTrap` hook to contain keyboard navigation\n- Added `role=\"dialog\"` and `aria-modal=\"true\"` attributes\n- Added `aria-labelledby` pointing to the title element\n- Added `role=\"presentation\"` to the outer container\n- Added `aria-hidden=\"true\"` to the backdrop\n- Added `tabIndex={-1}` to allow programmatic focus\n- Provides fallback hidden title via `sr-only` span when no visible title ID is passed\n\n**3. Updated `ReportView` (`src/components/report/ReportView.tsx`)**\n- Generates unique ID for the visible title using `useId()`\n- Passes `titleId` prop to `ReportShell` for proper `aria-labelledby` linking\n- Adds the `id` attribute to the visible `<h1>` title\n\n### Accessibility Benefits:\n- **WCAG 2.1 AA compliance**: Proper focus management is a requirement\n- **Screen reader support**: `aria-modal`, `role=\"dialog\"`, and `aria-labelledby` provide proper context\n- **Keyboard navigation**: Tab key cycles through focusable elements within the modal only\n- **Focus restoration**: Focus returns to the trigger element when the modal closes\n- **No focus escape**: Users can't accidentally tab to background content"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":225,"cache_read_input_tokens":109429,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":225},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a8a4f9ca-6a40-4b19-853c-2be96846861c","uuid":"bbcece26-e5e4-4085-b1f3-c29a3830bf8d"}
